cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GeoAreaWeight, please cite it as below."
title: "GeoAreaWeight: area weights and area-weighted statistics for latitude-longitude grids"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Longhao
    email: hhuwlh@163.com
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/GISWLH/GeoAreaWeight"
keywords:
  - area-weighted mean
  - latitude weighting
  - grid cell area
  - climate data
  - xarray
abstract: >-
  Correct area weights (cos-latitude, exact spherical band area, exact WGS84 cell area)
  and NaN-aware area-weighted means, regional means, area integrals and area fractions
  for latitude-longitude grids, with identical APIs in Python, R and MATLAB/Octave.
